# Suppression entries: one per intentional violation. Each entry MUST
# reference an audit ID (or "no-audit-id; rationale: <text>") and explain
# why the violation is acceptable.
#
# Format (NolintBeginEnd-style preferred where possible; this file is
# the catalog for global suppressions where in-source NOLINT is awkward).
#
# Initial contents: empty. Suppressions are added here only when an
# audit-ID-blessed exception requires them.
